{
  "_comment": "Sensor module catalog. 'sim' = the module's limits and noise: range window (min_range_m..range_m), horizontal field of view (fov_deg) and pointing (forward = along the platform heading, omni = 360 degrees), detection probability pd that falls to pd*pd_far at max range, rate_hz, latency_ms, and noise per native field. 'native' = what the module really reports (type + fields with units); a camera reports bearing and elevation, never range. 'weather_effects' = multipliers on range, noise and pd. All numbers are ASSUMED starting points to be tuned (confirm with the mentor) unless verified=true; 'spec' holds manufacturer facts.",
